476
00:42:43,623 --> 00:42:55,927
[SPEAKER_07]: Uh, their job is also to provide ventilation, uh, directly from outside, and that it also has, um, the appurtenances inside them that provide heating and cooling to these spaces.

477
00:42:57,648 --> 00:43:14,383
[SPEAKER_07]: A lot of the, so the current source of these, for example, cooling was an air-cooled chiller on the roof, and the heating source is non-condensing gas boilers that are inside a mechanical room.

478
00:43:15,203 --> 00:43:23,531
[SPEAKER_07]: In addition to that, we have some refrigerant-based systems that were also providing some cooling capabilities to some of the equipment that is inside

479
00:43:24,652 --> 00:43:28,676
